WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
Close the book to prepare the next ball.

00:01.500 --> 00:11.500
Open the book. The highlighted final digit scores six runs.

00:11.500 --> 00:21.500
A final digit of zero is out. The ball hits the stumps and the bails fly.

00:21.500 --> 00:25.000
Explore the offline cricket facts and their references.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
Six books. Solo, same-phone and nearby matches. Free at launch.
